<p class="objective">Classification of satellites into LEO, MEO, GEO, and HEO using MEAN_MOTION thresholds.</p>

<div class="callout">
  <strong>Classification methodology:</strong> Regimes are assigned using <strong>MEAN_MOTION</strong> (revolutions per day) thresholds:
  <strong>LEO</strong> = &gt;14 rev/day |
  <strong>MEO</strong> = 6–14 rev/day |
